	I have sources & 'man' pages for the following programs:

	(1) A UNIX-'touch'-like file date & time updater which
	accepts wildcarded filespecs (based on a single-file
	date & time updater originally posted as an example by
	a Mr. Bright)
	(2) An improved file (un)squeeze utility (original author is
	R.W. Sellens, I added some options & simplified filename
	specification).
	(3) A 'fortune cookie' program with approx. 150 quotes.

	All programs were compiled under Lattice-C V2.14 and run
	OK under MS-DOS 2.11 & 3.10. Pgm (3) was developped on a UNIX system
	and later ported, with trivial mods.
	Feel free to contact me via e-mail for sources and/or 'man'
	pages. If I get enough requests, etc...

